tree_hash
https://github.com/sigp/tree_hash
Maintained by Sigma Prime, for use in Lighthouse and the broader Ethereum ecosystem
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
(http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0)

  - packages/ethereum/tree_hash/
    A vendored fork of the upstream tree_hash crate, modified to use alloy-primitives.
    The crate keeps the upstream name, module layout (impls, merkle_hasher, merkleize_padded,
