The Ethereum light client in this repository is based on the Ethereum light client developed by
Union Labs for ibc-go's 08-wasm module.

  - packages/ethereum/light-client/
    The stateless verification implementation — Ethereum consensus verification, state proof
    verification, and header update handling. Its README records the derivation.
  - packages/ethereum/apis/
    The Ethereum RPC and beacon API clients and helpers. Its README records the derivation.
  - ibc-solidity/programs/cw-ics08-wasm-eth/
    The CosmWasm light client that holds the state for the above. Its README records that the
    implementation builds on the Union Labs work. The update_client path additionally follows
    the Ethereum Light Client Sync Protocol specification
    (https://github.com/ethereum/consensus-specs/blob/dev/specs/altair/light-client/sync-protocol.md),
    with modifications to support historical updates.


