  - Uniswap Permit2
    https://github.com/Uniswap/permit2
    Pinned to commit cc56ad0f3439c502c246fc5cfcc3db92bb8b7219.
  - SP1 Contracts
    https://github.com/succinctlabs/sp1-contracts
    The ISP1Verifier interface, pinned to commit d3629729c3216eb51bd4859d027a8eb729399fa4.
  - Forge Standard Library
    https://github.com/foundry-rs/forge-std
    Test-only, pinned to v1.15.0.
  - The Parity Technologies trie and RLP crates
    trie-db, hash-db, memory-db, hash256-std-hasher, rlp, rlp-derive, and primitive-types,
    consumed unmodified from crates.io.
  - The Sigma Prime SSZ crates
    ethereum_ssz, ethereum_ssz_derive, and tree_hash_derive, consumed unmodified from
    crates.io.

